        "items": [
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Passion, purpose and pay pull a career choice in different directions, and a workable plan usually secures a basic income first, then builds skill, then moves toward work that carries more interest and meaning as options grow."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Rank what you need now, what you want in a few years and what you can give up, then pick a first role that covers needs and teaches skills."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Ask for written terms and check the claims of any course that promises both passion and income."
          }
        ]
      },
